{"id": "d60d745a-e96f-46f7-ac60-66b5c291e51c", "slug": "flowmind-intelligent-automation", "title": "FlowMind - Intelligent Automation", "description": "Flowmind Intelligent Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"FlowMind - Intelligent Automation\"\ndescription: \"Flowmind Intelligent Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#00F5D4\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#00F5D4\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#0C1B26\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#1E2A35\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"5px\"\n  control: \"7px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# FlowMind - Intelligent Automation\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 79; favorites: 7; remixes: 0.\nTags: login, animated, threejs, input, validation, effect, security.\n## Overview\nFlowmind Intelligent Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nFLOWMIND Product Automations Connectors Docs Pricing Sign In Start Free Automation Status • Running Automate complex workflows with intelligent agents. FlowMind helps teams design, deploy, and monitor AI-powered automat…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Automate complex workflows with intelligent agents..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #00F5D4, secondary #000000, accent #00F5D4, background #000000, surface #0C1B26, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"bg-[#03070C] text-slate-200 overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#00F5D4]/30 selection:text-white\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>FlowMind - Intelligent Automation</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            cyan: '#00F5D4',\n                            dark: '#03070C',\n                            surface: '#0A1219',\n                            border: '#1E2A35'\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"font-sans min-h-screen relative flex flex-col pt-6 pb-12 px-6 md:px-12 xl:px-24 max-w-[1600px] mx-auto overflow-x-hidden\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #0c1b26 0%, #03070C 60%);\">\n\n    <!-- Background Grid -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-[-1]\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 50px 50px; perspective: 1000px;\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at center, transparent 0%, #03070C 100%);\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between z-50 mb-16 lg:mb-24\">\n        <!-- Logo -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer group\">\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,245,212,0.2) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,245,212,0.3);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:minimalistic-hexagon-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-xl absolute transition-transform group-hover:rotate-180 duration-700\"></iconify-icon>\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-brand-cyan rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_#00F5D4]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"font-medium tracking-wide text-sm text-white\">FLOWMIND</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Nav Links -->\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10 text-xs tracking-wider text-slate-400 uppercase\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Product</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Automations</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Connectors</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Docs</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Pricing</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Auth -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 text-xs tracking-wider uppercase\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 hidden sm:block\">Sign In</a>\n\n            <!-- Premium Surface Gradient Border Button -->\n            <button class=\"relative group rounded-md p-[1px] overflow-hidden\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-blue-500 opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                <div class=\"relative bg-brand-cyan text-[#03070C] px-6 py-2.5 rounded-[5px] font-medium flex items-center gap-2 hover:bg-opacity-90 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,245,212,0.3);\">\n                    Start Free\n                </div>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-8 relative z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Left Content -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center max-w-xl relative z-20\">\n\n            <!-- Badge -->\n            <div class=\"inline-flex mb-8 self-start rounded-full p-[1px]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0A1219] rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 border border-brand-border/50\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px #00F5D4;\" id=\"status-dot\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-widest text-slate-300 font-medium uppercase\">Automation Status • Running</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline with Masked Reveal Container -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight font-medium text-white leading-[1.1] mb-6\" id=\"headline\">\n                Automate complex workflows with <span class=\"text-brand-cyan relative inline-block\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,245,212,0.4);\">intelligent</span> agents.\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-md font-light\">\n                FlowMind helps teams design, deploy, and monitor AI-powered automations that get smarter over time.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTAs -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\">\n                <button class=\"group relative rounded-lg p-[1px] overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-cyan to-emerald-400\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative bg-brand-cyan text-[#03070C] px-8 py-3.5 rounded-[7px] font-medium text-sm tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2 hover:bg-white transition-colors duration-300\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,245,212,0.4);\">\n                        BUILD YOUR FLOW\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </button>\n\n                <button class=\"group relative rounded-lg p-[1px] overflow-hidden bg-brand-border\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative bg-[#0A1219] text-slate-300 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-[7px] font-medium text-sm tracking-wide flex items-center gap-3 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-slate-400 group-hover:text-brand-cyan transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                        SEE EXAMPLES\n                    </div>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Visual: 3D System Proxy -->\n        <div class=\"relative min-h-[500px] lg:min-h-full flex items-center justify-center -mr-12 lg:-mr-24 pointer-events-none\" id=\"visual-container\">\n\n            <!-- Connecting Lines SVG -->\n            <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 600\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n                <!-- Base lines -->\n                <g stroke=\"rgba(0,245,212,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                    <path d=\"M 250 200 L 400 300 L 550 200 L 650 150\" />\n                    <path d=\"M 400 300 L 450 400 L 550 500\" />\n                </g>\n                <!-- Animated Dashed Lines (Data Flow) -->\n                <g stroke=\"rgba(0,245,212,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"data-flow-paths\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(0,245,212,0.5));\">\n                    <path d=\"M 250 200 L 400 300 L 550 200 L 650 150\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 8\" />\n                    <path d=\"M 400 300 L 450 400 L 550 500\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 8\" />\n                </g>\n            </svg>\n\n            <!-- Node 1: Trigger -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[25%] left-[20%] sys-node flex flex-col items-start gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"relative group\">\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-border to-black p-[1px] relative z-10\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 2px 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A1219] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-cyan/5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:gamepad-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-2xl\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(0,245,212,0.5));\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 w-full h-full rounded-xl bg-brand-cyan/20 blur-xl -z-10 node-glow\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-left\">\n                        <div class=\"text-brand-cyan text-[10px] tracking-widest font-medium uppercase mb-0.5\">Trigger</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs font-light\">Event Received</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Node 2: Process 1 -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[40%] left-[40%] sys-node\">\n                <div class=\"relative group\">\n                    <div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-border to-black p-[1px] relative z-10\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 2px 15px rgba(0,245,212,0.1);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#080E14] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-3xl\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(0,245,212,0.6));\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute -bottom-3 -right-3 w-full h-full rounded-2xl bg-brand-cyan/30 blur-2xl -z-10 node-glow\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Node 3: Process 2 -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[30%] left-[65%] sys-node flex flex-col items-end gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-row-reverse\">\n                    <div class=\"relative group\">\n                        <div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-border to-black p-[1px] relative z-10\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 2px 20px rgba(0,245,212,0.2);\">\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#060A0F] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                <!-- Inner rings -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute w-16 h-16 border border-brand-cyan/20 rounded-full center-ring\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"absolute w-12 h-12 border border-brand-cyan/40 border-dashed rounded-full center-ring-reverse\"></div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magic-stick-3-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-4xl relative z-10\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(0,245,212,0.8));\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-full h-full rounded-2xl bg-brand-cyan/40 blur-3xl -z-10 node-glow\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n             <!-- Node 4: Decide -->\n             <div class=\"absolute top-[20%] left-[85%] sys-node flex flex-col items-start gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"relative group\">\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-border to-black p-[1px] relative z-10\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 2px 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A1219] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-2xl\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(0,245,212,0.5));\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 w-full h-full rounded-xl bg-brand-cyan/20 blur-xl -z-10 node-glow\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-left mt-10 absolute left-0 top-14 w-max\">\n                        <div class=\"text-brand-cyan text-[10px] tracking-widest font-medium uppercase mb-0.5\">Decide</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs font-light\">Smart Completed</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Node 5: Output Bottom -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[65%] left-[60%] sys-node flex flex-col items-start gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"relative group\">\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-border to-black p-[1px] relative z-10\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 2px 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A1219] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-2xl\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(0,245,212,0.5));\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 w-full h-full rounded-xl bg-brand-cyan/20 blur-xl -z-10 node-glow\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-left ml-2\">\n                        <div class=\"text-brand-cyan text-[10px] tracking-widest font-medium uppercase mb-0.5\">Process</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs font-light\">AI Agent Executes</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Stats Bar -->\n    <div class=\"w-full mt-16 z-20 relative\">\n        <!-- Border Gradient Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"w-full rounded-2xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-border/80 to-transparent\">\n            <div class=\"bg-[#050A10] rounded-2xl w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between py-8 px-6 lg:px-12 divide-y lg:divide-y-0 lg:divide-x divide-brand-border/50 shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]\">\n\n                <!-- Stat 1 -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 w-full lg:w-1/5 items-center lg:items-start py-4 lg:py-0 px-4\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:branching-paths-up-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"text-2xl font-medium text-white flex items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"counter\" data-target=\"1.2\">0</span>M+\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-light ml-9\">Workflows Run</div>\n                    <!-- Sparkline -->\n                    <svg class=\"w-24 h-6 mt-2 ml-9 opacity-50\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\">\n                        <path d=\"M0,15 L10,10 L20,18 L30,5 L40,12 L50,8 L60,16 L70,4 L80,10 L90,2 L100,8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00F5D4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"sparkline-path\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#00F5D4\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stat 2 -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 w-full lg:w-1/5 items-center lg:items-start py-4 lg:py-0 px-4\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"text-2xl font-medium text-white flex items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"counter\" data-target=\"98.6\">0</span>%\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-light ml-9\">Success Rate</div>\n                    <svg class=\"w-24 h-6 mt-2 ml-9 opacity-50\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\">\n                        <path d=\"M0,18 L15,12 L30,15 L45,8 L60,10 L75,4 L90,8 L100,2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00F5D4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"sparkline-path\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"2\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#00F5D4\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stat 3 -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 w-full lg:w-1/5 items-center lg:items-start py-4 lg:py-0 px-4\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:puzzle-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"text-2xl font-medium text-white flex items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"counter\" data-target=\"400\" data-decimals=\"0\">0</span>+\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-light ml-9\">Integrations</div>\n                    <svg class=\"w-24 h-6 mt-2 ml-9 opacity-50\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\">\n                        <path d=\"M0,10 L20,15 L40,5 L60,12 L80,2 L100,8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00F5D4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"sparkline-path\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#00F5D4\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stat 4 -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 w-full lg:w-1/5 items-center lg:items-start py-4 lg:py-0 px-4\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"text-2xl font-medium text-white flex items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"counter\" data-target=\"90\" data-decimals=\"0\">0</span>M+\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-light ml-9\">Tasks Automated</div>\n                    <svg class=\"w-24 h-6 mt-2 ml-9 opacity-50\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\">\n                        <path d=\"M0,16 L25,8 L50,14 L75,4 L100,10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00F5D4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"sparkline-path\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#00F5D4\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stat 5 -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 w-full lg:w-1/5 items-center lg:items-start py-4 lg:py-0 px-4\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" class=\"text-brand-cyan text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"text-2xl font-medium text-white\">\n                            24/7\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-light ml-9\">Always On</div>\n                    <svg class=\"w-24 h-6 mt-2 ml-9 opacity-50\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\">\n                        <path d=\"M0,8 L10,8 L20,8 L30,8 L40,8 L50,8 L60,8 L70,8 L80,8 L90,8 L100,8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00F5D4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Initialization Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Masked Word Reveal for Headline\n            const headline = document.getElementById('headline');\n            const words = headline.innerHTML.split(/(<[^>]*>| |\\n|<br>)/).filter(Boolean);\n\n            let newHtml = '';\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                if(word.trim() === '' || word === ' ' || word === '\\n' || word === '<br>') {\n                    newHtml += word;\n                } else if (word.startsWith('<span') || word.startsWith('</span')) {\n                     newHtml += word;\n                } else {\n                    // Wrap text nodes in masking spans\n                    newHtml += `<span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-1\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\">${word}</span></span>`;\n                }\n            });\n            headline.innerHTML = newHtml;\n\n            // Animate words\n            gsap.to('.reveal-word', {\n                y: '0%',\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: 'power3.out',\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // 2. Pulse Animation for Status Dot\n            gsap.to('#status-dot', {\n                opacity: 0.3,\n                scale: 0.8,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut'\n            });\n\n            // 3. 3D Node Floating Animation\n            gsap.to('.sys-node', {\n                y: -12,\n                duration: 2.5,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut',\n                stagger: {\n                    each: 0.4,\n                    from: \"random\"\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Node Glow Pulse\n            gsap.to('.node-glow', {\n                opacity: 0.5,\n                scale: 1.1,\n                duration: 2,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut',\n                stagger: 0.3\n            });\n\n            // Rotating Rings\n            gsap.to('.center-ring', {\n                rotation: 360,\n                duration: 10,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"none\"\n            });\n            gsap.to('.center-ring-reverse', {\n                rotation: -360,\n                duration: 15,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"none\"\n            });\n\n            // 4. SVG Data Flow Lines Animation\n            const paths = document.querySelectorAll('.data-flow-paths path');\n            paths.forEach(path => {\n                gsap.to(path, {\n                    strokeDashoffset: -20,\n                    duration: 1,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    ease: \"none\"\n                });\n            });\n\n            // 5. Sparkline Drawing Animation\n            gsap.fromTo('.sparkline-path',\n                { strokeDasharray: \"150\", strokeDashoffset: \"150\" },\n                {\n                    strokeDashoffset: 0,\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\",\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: \".counter\",\n                        start: \"top 90%\"\n                    }\n                }\n            );\n\n            // 6. Number Counters\n            const counters = document.querySelectorAll('.counter');\n            counters.forEach(counter => {\n                const target = parseFloat(counter.getAttribute('data-target'));\n                const decimals = counter.getAttribute('data-decimals') === '0' ? 0 : 1;\n\n                ScrollTrigger.create({\n                    trigger: counter,\n                    start: \"top 90%\",\n                    onEnter: () => {\n                        gsap.to(counter, {\n                            innerHTML: target,\n                            duration: 2,\n                            ease: \"power2.out\",\n                            snap: { innerHTML: Math.pow(10, decimals) / 10 },\n                            onUpdate: function() {\n                                counter.innerHTML = Number(this.targets()[0].innerHTML).toFixed(decimals);\n                            }\n                        });\n                    },\n                    once: true\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Mouse parallax effect for visual container\n            const container = document.getElementById('visual-container');\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const xAxis = (window.innerWidth / 2 - e.pageX) / 50;\n                const yAxis = (window.innerHeight / 2 - e.pageY) / 50;\n                gsap.to(container, {\n                    x: xAxis,\n                    y: yAxis,\n                    duration: 1,\n                    ease: 'power1.out'\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "flowmind-intelligent-automation.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/flowmind-intelligent-automation.jpg", "source_name": "flowmind-intelligent-automation-DESIGN.md", "views": 258, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:46:30.613614+00:00"}